{max:44.9,h:['The first edition becomes the last','Festival Season folds after Year One','The gates close for good'],s:['Ticket demand never catches the ambition of the bill. The weekend produces a few memories, but nobody signs the check for another summer.','The artists play, the lights come down, and the books stay red. By Monday morning, Year Two is off the table.','A festival happened. A sustainable festival did not. The investors walk before planning for next summer can begin.']},
